{"unit_id":"jsoncode__dsh-jenkins#feature-1","repo":"jsoncode/dsh-jenkins","commit":"9aabd0236d5b134ff7c92cf918f5fee97187b85a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jenkins 的功能「服务器配置」：在 DSH 设置页维护多个 Jenkins 服务器地址、用户名和 Token，并可测试连接。配置保存到宿主数据目录，供项目任务选择服务器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:109-138","src/client/plugin.tsx:166-186"]}
